The controller/reviewer must report planned and realized credited frames for:

- 55/45 source split
- every mission family and mandatory cell
- every random phase group and behavior family
- target, wall, approach sector, distance band, arc band, target region, path,
  interaction mode, contact sequence, outcome, and rest region
- Q-visible and Q-hidden frames
- Q rising/falling edges and hold duration
- aim-lock movement suppression and conflict combinations
- accepted and rejected E edges by rejection reason
- immediate/short/cooldown Q release profiles
- ready and cooldown crosshair frames
- grenade counts: total, flying, resting, and visible
- frames with zero, one, two-to-four, and five-or-more grenades
- airborne-plus-resting coexistence
