Initial audit bands, to be frozen numerically after the mixed calibration pilot:

- Q-visible observations: 35-45% of all V2 credited frames
- at least one live or resting grenade present: 35-50%
- cooldown observations: 20-30%
- cancelled previews: 25-35% of completed random aim sequences
- accepted throws: 65-75% of completed random aim sequences

Failure to hit an audit band is not repaired by inventing runtime recipes. The
planner or calibrated recipe weights must be revised and versioned.

